(7507080, 1197368, 86447, '<td valign="top">"We often remember people for the little things about them or their personality, what makes them who they are. Find someone, figure out what defines them, and illustrate it for us. Title your entry with the feature you are illustrating"<br/> <br/>I can''t find anything that works with this.  Does this man''s white hat define him or his personality?<br/> <br/>I must be missing it.</td>', '"We often remember people for the little things about them or their personality, what makes them who they are. Find someone, figure out what defines them, and illustrate it for us. Title your entry with the feature you are illustrating" I can''t find anything that works with this.  Does this man''s white hat define him or his personality? I must be missing it.', '2017-03-31 18:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7507081, 1197424, 86447, '<td valign="top">Love the muscles... and I agree that this fits the challenge perfectly... but I want more light in his eye area... even if his eye is closed.<br/> <br/>The rest is awesome!</td>', 'Love the muscles... and I agree that this fits the challenge perfectly... but I want more light in his eye area... even if his eye is closed. The rest is awesome!', '2017-03-31 18:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7507083, 1197314, 86447, '<td valign="top">"We often remember people for the little things about them or their personality, what makes them who they are. Find someone, figure out what defines them, and illustrate it for us. Title your entry with the feature you are illustrating"<br/> <br/>I''m not getting the connection of her dress to the feature that defines her or her personality.<br/> <br/>I think I''m too literal.<br/> <br/>I do love the portrait.  I just wish you''d chosen... uhh... "her beautiful hands" or "her understanding eyes"... or...   as her defining feature.</td>', '"We often remember people for the little things about them or their personality, what makes them who they are. Find someone, figure out what defines them, and illustrate it for us. Title your entry with the feature you are illustrating" I''m not getting the connection of her dress to the feature that defines her or her personality. I think I''m too literal. I do love the portrait.  I just wish you''d chosen... uhh... "her beautiful hands" or "her understanding eyes"... or...   as her defining feature.', '2017-03-31 18:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7507085, 1197213, 86447, '<td valign="top">The eyes look a bit not real to me... especially when the football looks totally real.<br/> <br/>I love what you''ve captured, just not thrilled with the processing.</td>', 'The eyes look a bit not real to me... especially when the football looks totally real. I love what you''ve captured, just not thrilled with the processing.', '2017-03-31 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
