(7507800, 1197573, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great non-traditional lighting.<br/> <br/>Photography puts a very large burden upon the viewer, to do their very best to understand why every detail and aspect of the photo is as it is. We must assume it is intentional, or intentionally chaotic. Here, I must defer to the   great instinct of the photog with respect to placement of the figure within the frame. well done.</td>', 'Great non-traditional lighting. Photography puts a very large burden upon the viewer, to do their very best to understand why every detail and aspect of the photo is as it is. We must assume it is intentional, or intentionally chaotic. Here, I must defer to the   great instinct of the photog with respect to placement of the figure within the frame. well done.', '2017-04-05 09:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7507804, 1197314, 167587, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the votes and the kind compliments.<br/> <br/>Some have questioned the relevance of this image to the challenge. Knowing the model, I think of the defining features of her personality to the polka dot dress in the same way that you might consider: a cigarette to Marlene Dietrich; street pajamas to Katherine Hepburn; giant glasses to Elton John, etc. It''s part of their "signature look," and we associate those looks with their features. In addition, I felt that her eyes echoed the polka dots very well. Perhaps one commenter was being "too literal" as they mentioned.<br/> <br/>To answer another question, yes, she is a writer in addition to be the General Manager of an extremely successful café and bakery. She does have an incredible presence - "an enviable being-there-ness" as <i>tnun</i> picked-up on. <br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the votes and the kind compliments. Some have questioned the relevance of this image to the challenge. Knowing the model, I think of the defining features of her personality to the polka dot dress in the same way that you might consider: a cigarette to Marlene Dietrich; street pajamas to Katherine Hepburn; giant glasses to Elton John, etc. It''s part of their "signature look," and we associate those looks with their features. In addition, I felt that her eyes echoed the polka dots very well. Perhaps one commenter was being "too literal" as they mentioned. To answer another question, yes, she is a writer in addition to be the General Manager of an extremely successful café and bakery. She does have an incredible presence - "an enviable being-there-ness" as tnun picked-up on.  Thanks again!', '2017-04-05 09:27:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7507838, 1197314, 100831, '<td valign="top">The post is beautifully on topic (spot on, I could say... hehehehe). Congrats on the high placement.</td>', 'The post is beautifully on topic (spot on, I could say... hehehehe). Congrats on the high placement.', '2017-04-05 13:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
